# /capture — drop a raw signal into Brain/inbox/

## Usage
/capture <text>

## What this does
Runs `brain capture "<text>"` which:
1. Creates `Brain/inbox/sig-<date>-<slug>.md` with YAML frontmatter (status: raw)
2. Appends to today's `Brain/log/YYYY-MM-DD.md`
3. Does NOT reason, route, or embed — cheap, fast, idempotent

## When to use
- You or the user has a thought, reference, or signal to preserve
- During a conversation when something noteworthy comes up
- Before any analysis — capture first, curate later

## Instructions
Execute: `brain capture "<user text>"`
Report the created inbox path.
Do not edit or analyze the signal at this stage.
